Which equation represents the graphed semicircle?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[<->] (-5.2,0) -- (1.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-5.2) -- (0,5.2) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {-4,-3,-2,-1,1} {\draw (\x,0.1) -- (\x,-0.1);}
\foreach \y in {-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4} {\draw (0.1,\y) -- (-0.1,\y);}
\draw[thick, blue] (0,4) arc (90:270:4);
\fill (0,-4) circle (2.5pt) node[below right] {$(0, -4)$};
\fill (0,4) circle (2.5pt) node[above right] {$(0, 4)$};
\fill (-4,0) circle (2.5pt) node[above left] {$(-4, 0)$};
\node[above right] at (0,0) {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
